{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00809","headline":"郊庙歌辞 後唐宗庙乐舞辞 应天舞 · 崔居俭、卢文纪","name":"郊庙歌辞 後唐宗庙乐舞辞 应天舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晋国肇兴，雄图再固。\n黼黻帝道，金玉王度。\n皇天无亲，惟德是辅。\n载诞英明，永光圣祚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔居俭、卢文纪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00809.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00809","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}